UHvsOf2uInVo5mU_U4Y87vRA6dg7CeunWXbVl1XKo_xka46Rx_kTiynmO67Jsw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTpW1jDsdzndQf4rWiZoou7UMfg7hhJevmg4FwTI-N0Gw&oe=6AFDD233"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_5.png", "id": "1541383568006698", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619382_1541383571340031_6581237163393541891_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Kkna5ro6X7UQ7kNvwFiHgs0&_nc_oc=Adpoeu_MBj3JnyCsNEdrqEbVTy6ieBO_copUFqQaW-58PU5w6-WhlzMEWhXNCgePq18&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSKlcVlGbl_sUX5qknOTpAgD-jbqPU8CkQZi5f4Tqv4eg&oe=6AFDAE95"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer_cover.png", "id": "973223461851149", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620599_973223465184482_6832655400416584737_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f5nGsQvunPwQ7kNvwE-p9Iz&_nc_oc=AdoRXS1qKtawa8juk22WUvvka2scTSCmdbn6NNJpebjGIXU-L40n0OaRNfw0nVCBkvY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSa4K1hN9ZTRItbTNDsNaKqNvYG8jN62K8xXSeO8ztjqg&oe=6AFDE129"}, "display_name": "Truck Simulator Texas", "keywords": ["truck", "trucking", "driving", "simulator", "texas"], "long_description": "The open road, from the driver's seat - in Texas.\n\nHOUSTON'S 610 LOOP\nA 38-mile loop of real Houston freeway built from real map data: the North Loop past the Heights, the West Loop under the Williams Tower and the Galleria, the South Loop past NRG Stadium and the Astrodome, then up the East Loop and over the Ship Channel bridge with the skyline alongside. Real ramps, real overpasses, the big interchange stacks and Downtown rising inside the loop.\n\nA SHOW TRUCK TO CALL HOME\nWalnut dash, cognac tufting, fourteen working gauges and a starlight headliner. Grip the wheel with your own hands, pull the air horn, set the parking brake - or drive with the joysticks.\n\nA REAL 10-SPEED\nPick AUTOMATIC and just drive, or switch to MANUAL and float a 10-speed through the H-pattern with a LO/HI range. Match the revs and it drops in. Miss it and it grinds.\n\nHAUL REAL TEXAS LOADS\nSix depots in real Houston places - Northside, the Lone Star Truck Stop, the Galleria, Brays Bayou, Gulfgate and the Port of Houston. Back under your trailer, take the load from dispatch and deliver it through Houston traffic.\n\nDAY AND NIGHT\nDrive at noon or after dark with the skyline lit up and the Williams Tower beacon sweeping the sky. Night runs pay extra.\n\nON THE RADIO\nA real dispatcher and five truckers on the CB with Texas road talk.\n\nTHE SLEEPER\nLeave the seat, walk back into the sleeper and sleep through to morning.\n\nPlus 17 achievements, 9 paints, a live map and Texas flags at every yard.", "short_description": "Grab the wheel of a long-nose show truck and haul freight around Houston's real 610 Loop. Run the North Loop past the Heights, the West Loop under the Williams Tower and the Galleria, the South Loop past NRG Stadium and the Astrodome, and climb the East Loop bridge over the Ship Channel, by day and by night. Shift a real 10-speed manual or let the automatic do it, take loads from dispatch, chat on the CB, then walk back and rest in your sleeper."}]}, "developer_name": "Citiview Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://citiview-games.pages.dev/trucksimulatortexas/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Citiview Studios", "support_website_url": "https://citiview-games.pages.dev/trucksimulatortexas/", "website_url": "https://citiview-games.pages.dev/trucksimulatortexas/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_M